{"words": [{"text": "وَإِذَا", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "قِيلَ", "translation": "it is said"}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "translation": "to them"}, {"text": "ءَامِنُوا۟", "translation": "Believe"}, {"text": "كَمَآ", "translation": "as"}, {"text": "ءَامَنَ", "translation": "believed"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّاسُ", "translation": "the people"}, {"text": "قَالُوٓا۟", "translation": "they say"}, {"text": "أَنُؤْمِنُ", "translation": "Should we believe"}, {"text": "كَمَآ", "translation": "as"}, {"text": "ءَامَنَ", "translation": "believed"}, {"text": "ٱلسُّفَهَآءُ ۗ", "translation": "the fools"}, {"text": "أَلَآ", "translation": "Beware"}, {"text": "إِنَّهُمْ", "translation": "certainly they"}, {"text": "هُمُ", "translation": "themselves"}, {"text": "ٱلسُّفَهَآءُ", "translation": "(are) the fools"}, {"text": "وَلَـٰكِن", "translation": "[and] but"}, {"text": "لَّا", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "يَعْلَمُونَ", "translation": "they know"}], "sahih": "And when it is said to them, \"Believe as the people have believed,\" they say, \"Should we believe as the foolish have believed?\" Unquestionably, it is they who are the foolish, but they know [it] not."}